Here’s the semantic interpretation of the scene images grounded in the provided ontology vocabulary.

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "City Intersection with Billboards" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .
:obstacle1 a :Billboard .
:weather1 a :ClearCondition .
:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Billboards may distract drivers" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .

:cc2 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather2 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .
:weather2 a :ClearCondition .
:risk2 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Multiple billboards in view could distract drivers" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .
:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.6"^^xsd:float .
```

